  "details": "so we have here the user action settings, where you can hide, show , and even put there avatar through the safety settings.\n\nI see this as a issue that can be transformed into a solution.\n\nIn unity there is this area called avatar hierchy where you can turn on and off certain areas to hide stuff on your avatar.\n\nWhy doesnt it just show a dropdown of the hierarchy? Obviously you cant really show all of it but power to the players right they should have the right to disable any part of the avatar which is accessible to everyone not just to one part of your system.",
